  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Basket project &#x2013; earthquake response in eastern AfghanistanBasket project &#x2013; earthquake response in eastern Afghanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On 31 August 2025, a powerful earthquake struck four provinces in eastern Afghanistan, causing extensive destruction and loss of life, especially in Kunar, Nangarhar, and Laghman provinces. This intervention is providing humanitarian and emergency support to the crisis affected populations in Afghanistan.</narrative>
  </description>
